==English==
{{rfi}}
{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|frm|en}} {{term|carobe|lang=fr}}, from Arabic {{term|خروب||locust bean pod|tr=kharrūb|lang=ar}}, from Assyrian [[kharubu]].

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# An [[evergreen]] [[shrub]] or [[tree]], {{taxlink|Ceratonia siliqua|species|noshow=1}},  native to the [[Mediterranean]] region.
# The fruit of that tree.
# A sweet chocolate-like confection made with the pulp of the fruit.

====Synonyms====
* [[St. John's bread]]
* [[locust bean]]

